## ✨ Features

- 🔍 Detects **Fair Value Gaps (FVG)** on 15-minute charts
- 🤖 Fully **automated trading** using Binance API
- 📊 **RSI-based filtering** to avoid false signals
- 📈 **1:3 Risk-to-Reward** ratio management
- 🧠 Simple, readable Python code
- 📋 Trade logging & analytics
- 🖥️ GUI with `tkinter` for real-time control (optional)

